[{"client_msg_id":"76123a1f-0817-4ceb-b0b7-18d44395e4da","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ又貸しになるから賃貸では難しいだろうけど。","ts":"1632723652.030700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V9m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bb946ac-48ab-4a62-9eb0-608bc0fcd1b9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":puro: :banjaku:","ts":"1632723634.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"staq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"329f6705-1c34-4e99-ab1a-e2c55839dfc4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ベースは個人にして、会社から給与とは別に家賃払って、個人で所得税払うってのもある。","ts":"1632723632.030100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lXH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6A7E1C8C-40DD-4E7E-A4E7-74115183CCF1","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そっすね。それは日本も同じで、なので今回は最初から法人契約です。ただ、ベースが住居契約なので、本当は住居兼事務所が色々良かった","ts":"1632722688.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3+wQl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecf17d5a-92fb-4d8b-9a2a-53049b090bb1","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"うちの場合会計士に聞いたところ、condoのrentの契約を個人名にせず会社名にしないと厳しいみたいなことを言われてしまいました","ts":"1632722541.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cIQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bca1532-31ea-42af-820d-cc9eb3fab417","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おおー :puro:","ts":"1632722509.026800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eH=XJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EB80B4F5-D432-4AA6-9656-6A9774DBDF0F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"引っ越し後の自宅経費化プロジェクトは、税理士との会議の結果、この解釈に従って50%を会社負担で決着することになりました。\n\u003chttps://www.nta.go.jp/taxes/shiraberu/taxanswer/gensen/2600.htm|https://www.nta.go.jp/taxes/shiraberu/taxanswer/gensen/2600.htm\u003e","ts"